     "t": "Simple febrile: generalised, < 15 min, once per illness, no deficit",
     "s": "paedstg2026:13.13"
    },
    {
     "t": "Complex febrile: ≥ 15 min, OR recurrent in same illness, OR focal, OR post-ictal focal signs",
